          "eyebrow": "The Story",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Discovering",
            "accent": "the Amalfi Coast"
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Loreana was in Rome with her friends, visiting Italy for a short trip from Peru. The Amalfi Coast was something she had never heard much about. While in Rome, her friends told her about the dramatic cliffs, colorful towns, and hidden streets. She decided to travel alone for a couple of days and contacted me through GetYourGuide on a Sunday morning — asking if a photoshoot could be arranged within a few hours."
          ]
        }
      ]
